OL,3,AAsh from Mount Etna grounds flights at
OL,4,ASicily airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll flights have been suspended from
OL,7,Fone of Italy's busiest airports because
OL,8,Fof volcanic ash released from nearby
OL,9,FMount Etna.
OL,11,FIt is the second time in recent months
OL,12,Fthat Catania International Airport, on
OL,13,Fthe island of Sicily, has stopped
OL,14,Fflights due to emissions from Etna,
OL,15,Fwhich is Europe's tallest active
OL,16,Fvolcano and erupts frequently.
OL,18,FAirport officials said arrivals and
OL,19,Fdepartures, which were first halted on
OL,20,FMonday, would be suspended until 22:00
OL,21,F(20:00 GMT) on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
